; DIMALIGNED, the Mtext option ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930): before Text, as AutoCAD
; ([testoM/Testo/Angolo] in autocad-quote.txt, dxf-test-file 5170f18); from the command line
; it asks "Enter dimension text <measurement>:" and writes the replaced text, as Text
; (PT3 card, point 3). First dimension: a text with <>; second: a text without <>.
; Values as dimaligned/punti-testo-angolo (same points, ISO-25): u = (0.6, 0.8), the text
; 1.875 along the normal from the middle, six graphics records, so 257 and 264.
DIMALIGNED
0,0
30,40
; cambia con #930
M
<> mm
-8,6
DIMALIGNED
100,0
130,40
M
Quota A
92,6
